ems. Sunrise Purdue is a Sunrise hub based in West Lafayette aiming to unite the Greater Lafayette community to take back out power through grassroots organizing, mutual aid, political education, coalition building, and direct action. \n\nNote: Sunrise members have to be under 35, but if you would like to be a 35+ supporter, here are our supporter guidelines.","email":"sunrisewestlaf@gmail.com","website":"https://linktr.ee/sunrise.purdue","twitter":null,"facebook":null,"instagram":"https://instagram.com/sunrise.purdue","signup":null,"donations":"https://secure.actblue.com/donate/sunrisepurdue","websiteText":"Hub Linktree","logo":{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","aspectRatio":1,"src":"/static/285a0dcc768826c19643ec5461da0444/6d161/SUNRISE%20PURDUE%20(2).png.png","srcSet":"/static/285a0dcc768826c19643ec5461da0444/94657/SUNRISE%20PURDUE%20(2).png.png 38w,\n/static/285a0dcc768826c19643ec5461da0444/5db04/SUNRISE%20PURDUE%20(2).png.png 75w,\n/static/285a0dcc768826c19643ec5461da0444/6d161/SUNRISE%20PURDUE%20(2).png.png 150w,\n/static/285a0dcc768826c19643ec5461da0444/7e7e9/SUNRISE%20PURDUE%20(2).png.png 225w,\n/static/285a0dcc768826c19643ec5461da0444/630fb/SUNRISE%20PURDUE%20(2).png.png 300w,\n/static/285a0dcc768826c19643ec5461da0444/bbee5/SUNRISE%20PURDUE%20(2).png.png 1800w","sizes":"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px"}}},"hero":null,"documents":[]}},"pageContext":{"id":"99ed3bf2-7b51-5eb3-9ff1-3dbd15703214"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1219170061","3649515864"]}